	"intro": [
		"Enchanting puts lasting magic on gear and makes oils and wands. Its materials come from breaking green items with Disenchant, which Enchanting teaches, or from the Auction House; no gathering profession is needed. Tailoring is a good partner: its green cloth items break into dust.",
		"Disenchanting gives skill too: a point for nearly every item up to 20, fewer after that, none from 60. Every enchant goes onto an item, worn or in the bags, and one item takes them all.",
